{"path":"thread/thread/native_handle","title":"std::thread::native_handle","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::thread::</span>native_handle","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/thread/native_handle","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the implementation defined underlying thread handle.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">native_handle_type native_handle<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark\">(not always present)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the implementation defined underlying thread handle. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Implementation defined handle type representing the thread.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>Uses <code>native_handle</code> to enable realtime scheduling of C++ threads on a POSIX system.</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstring&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;mutex&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;pthread.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;thread&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/mutex\"><span class=\"kw2175\">std::<span class=\"me2\">mutex</span></span></a> iomutex<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> num<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/sleep_for\"><span class=\"kw2170\">std::<span class=\"me2\">this_thread</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">sleep_for</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1001\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">seconds</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    sched_param sch<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> policy<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> \n    pthread_getschedparam<span class=\"br0\">(</span>pthread_self<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>policy, <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>sch<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/lock_guard\"><span class=\"kw2187\">std::<span class=\"me2\">lock_guard</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/mutex\"><span class=\"kw2175\">std::<span class=\"me2\">mutex</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> lk<span class=\"br0\">(</span>iomutex<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Thread \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> num <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" is executing at priority \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> sch.<span class=\"me1\">sched_priority</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/thread\"><span class=\"kw2167\">std::<span class=\"me2\">thread</span></span></a> t1<span class=\"br0\">(</span>f, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, t2<span class=\"br0\">(</span>f, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    sched_param sch<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> policy<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> \n    pthread_getschedparam<span class=\"br0\">(</span>t1.<span class=\"me1\">native_handle</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>policy, <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>sch<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    sch.<span class=\"me1\">sched_priority</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">20</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>pthread_setschedparam<span class=\"br0\">(</span>t1.<span class=\"me1\">native_handle</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, SCHED_FIFO, <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>sch<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Failed to setschedparam: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/strerror\"><span class=\"kw1169\">std::<span class=\"me2\">strerror</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">errno</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    t1.<span class=\"me1\">join</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> t2.<span class=\"me1\">join</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Thread 2 is executing at priority 0\nThread 1 is executing at priority 20</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"},{"path":"thread/thread","title":"std::thread"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::thread::native_handle","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Returns the implementation defined underlying thread handle."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Implementation defined handle type representing the thread."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"Example","note":"Uses native_handle to enable realtime scheduling of C++ threads on a POSIX system."}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":140,"codeBlockCount":2}
